#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:7 8b3d0ab7ebf0408ea774fce3ef5fcb82
msgid "Remote ID (aka Drone ID)"
msgstr "远程 ID（即无人机 ID）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:13 03829a66ce914a568f2f08e875073e4e
msgid ""
"Remote IDs are becoming a legal requirement in some countries. Below is a "
"list of devices compatible with ArduPilot. There is a quite nice explanation"
" and list of frequently asked questions regarding Remote ID available `here "
"<https://drone-remote-id.com/>`__ (site hosted by Dronetag)"
msgstr ""
"在某些国家，远程 ID 正在成为法律要求。以下是兼容 ArduPilot 的设备列表。关于远程 ID 的详细解释和常见问题，可在 `此处 "
"<https://drone-remote-id.com/>`__ 找到一份相当不错的说明（该网站由 Dronetag 托管）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:16 9e5fce5fa5804e2ebdbdddd50618b448
msgid "Variations"
msgstr "版本差异"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:18 8a169577b6f54586a8f6f5dc7491d4b3
msgid ""
"There are basically two differing Remote ID requirements, although specifics"
" vary according to country/region: devices integrated into OEM supplied "
"systems, and add-on beacons for DIY and existing vehicles."
msgstr ""
"远程 ID 要求基本上有两种类型，但具体规定因国家/地区而异：集成在 OEM 供应系统中的设备，以及适用于 DIY 和现有飞行器的附加信标。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:20 bbb6e1a853ba4d66b1460e48e1c1ee95
msgid ""
"For the ones users will be adding, there are variations on whether the "
"device gets GPS position information via an integrated GPS or from the "
"autopilot using its position and other information for its GPS. If connected"
" to the autopilot for position and other information via MAVLink, either "
"proprietary firmware or firmware conforming to the OpenDroneID standard is "
"used to implement Remote ID(see following section) can be used. Power can be"
" supplied either from the vehicle (MAVLink connection or to the vehicle's "
"power), or via a small rechargeable battery (completely self contained units"
" which can be transferred between vehicles easily)."
msgstr ""
"对于用户需要自行添加的设备，其差异主要在于设备是通过内置 GPS 还是从飞控获取 GPS 位置信息（使用飞控的位置及其他信息作为 GPS "
"数据）。如果通过 MAVLink 连接飞控以获取位置等信息，可使用专有固件或符合 OpenDroneID 标准的固件来实现远程 "
"ID（见以下章节）。供电可来自飞行器（通过 MAVLink "
"连接或连接到飞行器电源），也可来自小型可充电电池（完全独立的设备，可在不同飞行器之间方便转移）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:23 0d52a750c61d463bb76ef2ccff4f3cfd
