#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:64 527fbbfe19344e118722e32369c70fa6
msgid "OpenDroneID"
msgstr "OpenDroneID"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:70 52f20d93cc034934b38ce9bb61a99585
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides support for OpenDroneID in firmware versions 4.2 and "
"later via MAVLink to an OpenDroneID compatible RemoteID module attached to "
"either a serial port or DroneCAN port on the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 在固件版本4.2及更高版本中通过 MAVLink 提供对 OpenDroneID 的支持，可连接到飞控串口或 DroneCAN "
"端口上的兼容 OpenDroneID 的远程 ID 模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:72 7fa26a88f74c4b4a8eb01f7992f25a92
msgid ""
"In order to provide tamper protection, a special autopilot firmware must be "
"built and loaded on the autopilot which: enables this feature, prevents "
"loading non-compliant firmware via GCS or normal uploaders, and provides "
"further tamper-proofing."
msgstr ""
"为提供防篡改保护，必须构建并加载特殊的飞控固件，该固件可：启用此功能，防止通过地面站或普通上传工具加载不合规固件，并提供进一步的防篡改措施。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:74 a69d9d6f2d94458395839f8568087341
msgid ""
"For details on building firmware with the OpenDroneID feature, see "
":ref:`dev:opendroneid` for details."
msgstr "有关构建具有 OpenDroneID 功能的固件的详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`dev:opendroneid`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:77 55c409f72c174a4b9a5c87f25a56bc44
msgid "ArduRemoteID"
msgstr "ArduRemoteID"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:79 7772e68a4b1f4f06b751f7a23125678c
msgid ""
"ArduPilot also has developed firmware for  ESP32-S3 and C3 development "
"boards for an OpenDroneID compatible Remote ID module for attachment by "
"serial MAVLink connection or DroneCAN to the autopilot. A binary for "
"flashing the board, along with instructions, is `available here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ArduRemoteID>`__.  Note, this firmware is "
"rapidly evolving, so check for updates frequently. This device can be "
"attached to the autopilot by USB, serial, or DroneCAN (if an external CAN "
"transceiver is attached)"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 还为 ESP32-S3 和 C3 开发板开发了固件，用于通过串口 MAVLink 连接或 DroneCAN 连接到飞控的兼容 "
"OpenDroneID 远程 ID 模块。用于烧录开发板的二进制文件及说明 `可在此处获取 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ArduRemoteID>`__。请注意，此固件正在快速迭代，请经常检查更新。该设备可通过 "
"USB、串口或 DroneCAN（如果连接了外部 CAN 收发器）与飞控相连"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:84 6a06dc77b05748ea8654a1aa90ce1a59
msgid ""
"This firmware provides security signing and locking features for tamper "
"resistance on the ArduRemoteID module:"
msgstr "此固件为 ArduRemoteID 模块提供安全签名和锁定功能以防止篡改："

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:86 51e5a1752e614a01a8829f498d2e9366
msgid ""
"if the board has a USB programming port, access to that port, as well as the"
" DroneCAN and MAVLink parameters, normally setup before shipment to "
"customers can be locked, either temporarily or permanently, requiring a "
"security key pair and secure commands to be used to alter those parameters."
msgstr ""
"如果开发板具有 USB 编程接口，在出厂前通常会配置好访问该接口的权限以及 DroneCAN 和 MAVLink "
"参数，这些均可被临时或永久锁定，需要使用安全密钥对和安全命令才能更改这些参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:87 243e4324b408440c8bc33316c9beeee0
msgid ""
"when in a locked state, the only way to update firmware is to use a secure "
"WIFI web interface provided by the module using a public/private key pair."
msgstr "在锁定状态下，更新固件的唯一方式是使用该模块提供的基于公私钥对的安全 WIFI 网页界面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:89 d92cdc5735014cf2aaa92f86947d6270
msgid ""
"See the detailed instructions in the `ArduRemoteID README.md file "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ArduRemoteID>`__."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 `ArduRemoteID README.md 文件 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ArduRemoteID>`__ 中的详细说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:92 aad5d85f97534c0d9bd109dd89973473
msgid "End User Data Setup and Use"
msgstr "终端用户数据设置与使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:94 39a48790b8644c21acc63a20e376a21c
msgid ""
"Mission Planner (must be the latest beta version) has a tab in its DATA view"
" (Drone ID) for OpenDrone ID operation which allows connection of the "
"required external serial GPS to obtain operation location, and set up tabs "
"for UAS and Operator IDs if required by your local jurisdiction. It also "
"shows the Remote ID status. The ground station will also have status and "
"pre-arm failure messages displayed if there are problems."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner（必须为最新 beta 版本）在其 DATA 视图中有一个 OpenDrone ID 操作标签（Drone "
"ID），可连接所需的外部串口 GPS 以获取操作位置，并可根据当地法规设置 UAS 和操作者 ID。同时也会显示远程 ID "
"状态。如果出现问题，地面站也会显示状态和解锁前失败消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:97 5c325c7f443f4a6b88c9d95e4b9e1127
msgid "Other GCS are developing similar OpenDroneID setup wizards."
msgstr "其他地面站正在开发类似的 OpenDroneID 设置向导。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:101 34d74f4f1fae402e87b13d338a51155b
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-remoteid.rst:103 99cce70d38b448caab17c90eb8398fe6
msgid ""
"See :ref:`OpenDroneID <dev:opendroneid>` for information on how to build "
"firmware for OpenDroneID and to run the code on autopilot to experiment with"
" parameters, etc."
msgstr ""
"有关如何为 OpenDroneID 构建固件以及在飞控上运行代码以实验参数等的信息，请参阅 :ref:`OpenDroneID "
"<dev:opendroneid>`。"

